      "writtenOn": "2025-09-29T09:06:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Perhaps it is better as you suggested, to pass a flag to  __pkvm_hyp_donate_host(), so we would not forget to think whether we should clear this memory in each case",
      "parentUuid": "471f4f2b_969765a3",
      "revId": "5871a97a10b053c572926f854e77bf3427abfe57",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a8a630fc_012eca8f",
        "filename": "arch/x86/kvm/pkvm/pkvm.c",
